    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Squad: RAW Ops</strong> is a straightforward, action-packed third-person shooter. Take on the role of a RAW agent and blast your way through quick missions\u2014shoot enemies, explode barrels for slow-motion effects, rescue hostages, diffuse bombs, and find hidden intel. The gameplay is fast, fun, and easy to pick up, with a simple story that keeps you moving from one mission to the next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual Third-Person Shooter:</strong> Easy-to-learn controls and fast-paced action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive Gameplay:</strong> Blast barrels to trigger slow-motion and clear your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Missions:</strong> Rescue, bomb defusal, and intel gathering\u2014just jump in and play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, Focused Levels:</strong> Perfect for quick play sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Moments:</strong> Enjoy basic cutscenes and dramatic moments as you progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump into the action, complete your objectives, and Finish all the tactical action packed missions.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Squad: RAW Ops</strong> is a straightforward, action-packed third-person shooter. Take on the role of a RAW agent and blast your way through quick missions\u2014shoot enemies, explode barrels for slow-motion effects, rescue hostages, diffuse bombs, and find hidden intel. The gameplay is fast, fun, and easy to pick up, with a simple story that keeps you moving from one mission to the next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual Third-Person Shooter:</strong> Easy-to-learn controls and fast-paced action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive Gameplay:</strong> Blast barrels to trigger slow-motion and clear your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Missions:</strong> Rescue, bomb defusal, and intel gathering\u2014just jump in and play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, Focused Levels:</strong> Perfect for quick play sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Moments:</strong> Enjoy basic cutscenes and dramatic moments as you progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump into the action, complete your objectives, and Finish all the tactical action packed missions.</strong></p>",
